+### Criterion 11 — the computed difference table
+
+Per phase: median of the three per-repeat p50s (build and raster
+separately), summed, then Run 1 − Run 2:
+
+| phase | Run 1 (text on), ms | Run 2 (control), ms | **difference** | vs. 0.5 ms |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
